<file path="README.md">
# Serde JCS

[![github][shield-img-github]][shield-url-github]
[![crates.io][shield-img-crates]][shield-url-crates]
[![docs.rs][shield-img-docs]][shield-url-docs]
[![build status][shield-img-ci]][shield-url-ci]

JSON Canonicalization Scheme (JCS) for Serde.

**serde_jcs** turns [Serde][ref-url-serde] data into the canonical JSON of [RFC 8785][ref-url-rfc8785].

---

## Usage

Add the following to your `Cargo.toml`:

```toml
[dependencies]
serde_jcs = "0.3"
```

